{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>FocusVille 是一款把專注時間變成像素村莊的限時免費工具，適合學生、在職人士、寫作人及開發者等希望減少分心、建立專注習慣的用家。原價 US $3.99，現於 App Store 限時免費。它以番茄式計時配合村莊建造獎勵，讓你放下手機完成 15 至 90 分鐘的專注時段，全程毋須註冊帳戶，亦可離線使用。</p>\n\n<h2>專注時間換取村莊資源</h2>\n<p>選好建築物，投入 15 至 90 分鐘的番茄式專注時段，村民便會替你伐木、採石與挖泥。完成計時即可取得資源，用來升級木材小屋、石礦場與黏土坑；中途中斷離開，當日收穫便會失去。程式支援 iOS 屏幕使用時間封鎖分心應用，並可完全離線運作。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-584-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-585-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-586-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-587-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-588-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-589-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：FocusVille: Focus &amp; Build</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-24T22:38:26.045546+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":349,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}